OL,3,GNEWSASupercars seized ahead of wedding
OL,4,Aafter M5 incident
OL,5,
OL,6,FA convoy of supercars en route to a
OL,7,Fwedding have been seized after reports
OL,8,Fof motorists driving dangerously on
OL,9,Fseveral motorways, police have said.
OL,11,FOfficers were called at 18:10 BST on
OL,12,FSunday to reports of four cars being
OL,13,Fdriven dangerously on the M4 and M5
OL,14,Fnear the M32 junction to Bristol.
OL,16,FThe high-end vehicles, two Audi R8s, a
OL,17,FMercedes G63 Wagon and a Lamborghini
OL,18,FHuracan, were pulled over on the A370
OL,19,Fat Hewish in North Somerset, Avon and
OL,20,FSomerset Police confirmed.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,342,340,200,160,0,100
