OL,3,GNEWSASupercars seized ahead of wedding
OL,4,Aafter M5 incident
OL,5,
OL,6,FA force spokesperson added: "The
OL,7,Fmotorway is not the place for a wedding
OL,8,Fconvoy to become a rolling supercar
OL,9,Fshowcase, putting other road users in
OL,10,Fdanger."
